script = ExtResource("1_58raw")
dialogue_id = "debate_talisman_scent_bag"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Talismans"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: Many people today look at our customs as thoughtless imitation.
scribe: They think we are children following arbitrary rules.
scribe: But let us examine the simple herbal sachets that so many of us carry.
scribe: Generations ago, the Enlightened One instructed our ancestors to pack small pouches with dried mugwort, mint, and cypress.
scribe: For centuries, we have worn them as a symbol of our harmony with the woods, a reminder to reject the decadent perfumes of the past.
scribe: Recently, our scholars and healers have begun to study the hidden properties of these common plants.
scribe: They have discovered that the oils in these herbs repel the unseen pests that carry disease, and their scent clears the lungs when the winter damp sets in.
scribe: Our ancestors who kept these sachets tied around their necks survived illnesses that claimed others.
scribe: They did not need to understand why the herbs were important.
scribe: They only needed to follow the divine wisdom.
scribe: We can study the world to comprehend the machinery of miracles, without rejecting the ones we cannot yet explain.
scribe: Faith is the candle we carry to push away the dark, until our knowledge is bright enough to dispel it."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
